#: src/modules/Client/templates/admin/mod_client_summary_cards.html.twig
msgid "Each active or suspended service is cancelled as with Cancel on its order page: the server account is cancelled, its open renewal and first invoices are cancelled, a payment subscription stops and the client gets the usual email. Nothing is refunded and no credit is given."
msgstr "Hver aktiv eller suspenderet tjeneste annulleres som med Annuller på dens ordreside: serverkontoen annulleres, dens åbne fornyelses- og første fakturaer annulleres, et betalingsabonnement stopper, og kunden får den sædvanlige e-mail. Intet refunderes, og der gives ingen kredit."

#: src/modules/Client/templates/admin/mod_client_manage.html.twig
msgid "Each active service is suspended as with Suspend on its order page, with your reason: the server account is suspended and the client gets the usual email. Add-ons go with their service."
